	"limits": "Maintainer experiment in a Linux x64 VM, never an extension dependency. Upstream prebuilt N-API6 binding loaded directly by Bun; no Node/Python executable, install scripts, root dependency or lock changes. Portable basic graph optimization, CPU provider, instrumented duration output retained. ORT read variants compare basic versus disabled runtime optimization and explicit prepacking enabled (0) versus disabled (1); enabled is equivalent to the runtime default. CPU browser samples use fresh workers and the copied production manifest; two rotated rounds. Fixture fetch and maintainer conversion excluded from firstBufferMs, which includes worker startup, ORT initialization, real session creation, phonemizer and first synthesis. Noise disabled only to compare deterministic PCM and aligned word records. This does not establish audible quality, physical GPU, Firefox, Windows, full catalog, storage-read or target-device acceptance. MIT runtime and separate third-party notices are retained in vendor/onnxruntime; model obligations remain separate. No prepared artifact is published by this script.",
